{"_id":"69a57aae3258582713dc3193","roadmapSlug":"ai-engineer","nodeId":"kG1bkF2oY21CJOm9zhdpn","description":"# Multi-Agent Systems\n\nMulti-agent systems involve the coordinated behavior of multiple intelligent agents within an environment. These agents interact with each other, potentially cooperating or competing, to achieve individual or collective goals. The complexity arises from the need for agents to reason about the actions, intentions, and knowledge of other agents to make informed decisions and effectively navigate the environment.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"What is a multi-agent system?","url":"https://www.ibm.com/think/topics/multiagent-system","_id":"6a7e0e73cb44947deb677f21"},{"type":"article","title":"Multi-Agent Systems","url":"https://huggingface.co/learn/agents-course/en/unit2/smolagents/multi_agent_systems","_id":"6a7e0e73cb44947deb677f22"},{"type":"article","title":"Guide to multi-agent systems (MAS)","url":"https://cloud.google.com/discover/what-is-a-multi-agent-system","_id":"6a7e0e73cb44947deb677f23"},{"type":"article","title":"Agentic AI 103: Building Multi-Agent Teams","url":"https://towardsdatascience.com/agentic-ai-103-building-multi-agent-teams/?utm_source=roadmap&utm_medium=Referral&utm_campaign=TDS+roadmap+integration","_id":"6a7e0e73cb44947deb677f24"}],"createdAt":"2026-03-02T11:55:26.233Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-13T18:35:31.429Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d04165c9","title":"DataCamp - Associate AI Engineer for Developers","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/E0Y9kD"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/ai-engineer/content/kG1bkF2oY21CJOm9zhdpn.md"}